claude-rag-hook (0.2.1-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Fix: auto-index incorrectly refused direct children of $HOME, even
    those with project markers. Folders like ~/regurio-monorepo,
    ~/projects/foo, ~/code/bar are common and legitimate places to
    keep a project; refusing them out of an abundance of caution
    silently broke the integration ('rag:' looked like it did
    nothing). The project-marker requirement and the size cap already
    gate everything that needs gating; the redundant rule is dropped.
    $HOME itself is still refused.

